# The worker image needs only the generator and tools/jobs (allow-list): it
# must not be able to see the Electron app, node_modules, or the rest of the
# repo, so a careless COPY can't balloon the image or leak unrelated files.
*
!tools/molecules/*.py
!tools/molecules/requirements.lock
!tools/jobs/
tools/jobs/.state/
tools/jobs/tests/
**/__pycache__/
